# Conformance probe pack for `swap` on a field that is not byte-aligned (spec
# 0.22, ruling 13), least significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   bits 4..19    x      16 bits in two chunks of 8, taken in reverse order
format     conformance-long-swap-offset-lsb
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  lsb
field   probe.x  0:4:16  uint  swap
